      "id": "p0258-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The name \"Jimmy Hotpants\" comes from a personal experience Toby had during a game of laser tag. Apparently, the top scorer at one point was named \"Jimmy Hotpants\", and the name was so ridiculous that it stuck with Toby long after.",
