    {
      "id": "p0258-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The ridiculous sound and associated imagery of the name \"Jimmy Hotpants\" would be dulled in a literal transcription into Japanese. As such, the translator altered the name to \"Jimmy Zubonski\", which contains three levels of wordplay:",
        "raw": "The ridiculous sound and associated imagery of the name \"Jimmy Hotpants\"\nwould be dulled in a literal transcription into Japanese. As such, the translator\naltered the name to \"Jimmy Zubonski\", which contains three levels of wordplay:",
